 page management differ from a generic social media agency?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"(1) Industry-native writer + strategist team: we understand your industry, buyer psychology, regulatory context, competitor landscape. (2) LinkedIn-native (not general social): LinkedIn algorithm rewards long-form + engagement + employee amplification, very different from Instagram/Facebook. (3) Company + individual + employee tri-brand strategy: we run all three together, most agencies only do one. (4) Employee advocacy programme setup + management. (5) Talent-acquisition + culture-content specialisation. (6) Compliance + industry-specific + crisis-communication expertise. (7) Transparent retainer + 6-month MSA + 100% client IP."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do we start LinkedIn company page management with ITD for a Bengaluru manufacturing SME?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Free 30-min discovery call. We audit your current company page + benchmark against 3-5 competing Bengaluru-based manufacturing SMEs + share customised 90-day plan + tier recommendation + first-30-day content plan within 3 working days. If you proceed: 1-week onboarding (page audit + optimisation + team introduction + content-approval workflow) + first content live in week 2 + employee-advocacy programme activation in week 3."}}]}</script>
