    <div class="itdgl-faq-list" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage">
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What does LinkedIn company page management include for a Bengaluru manufacturing SME?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Full-stack monthly deliverables: (1) Company page setup + optimisation (About + Life + Products + Careers tabs), (2) Weekly posts (10-16 per month) on Product engineering deep-dives + plant + quality process content + export success stories + industry regulation updates + trade-show recap + supplier + customer partnership announcements, (3) Long-form articles (2-3/month) — SEO-optimised for LinkedIn search + external Google, (4) Video + graphic content (4-8/month), (5) Employee advocacy programme — activating your team as amplifiers, (6) Showcase pages for specific products/services/business-units, (7) Life tab + culture content for talent acquisition, (8) Careers + hiring posts, (9) LinkedIn Analytics + monthly performance review. In Bengaluru with 55+ lakh LinkedIn members. Densest cluster of SaaS founders + engineering VPs + product managers + design leaders + PE/VC + fintech founders in India. Startup-founder LinkedIn scene very active., well-executed company page adds 2K-15K/month follower growth for scaling firms.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What is a realistic monthly cost for LinkedIn company page management for a Bengaluru manufacturing SME?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">In Bengaluru: Rs 35-80K starter, Rs 80K-1.8L growth, Rs 1.8-3.5L enterprise. Ad spend separate. Standalone company page management works but bundled with founder/CXO personal branding + LinkedIn Ads at Growth tier is usually 30-50% more cost-effective + drives 2-3x more results because personal + company brand reinforce each other.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How does employee advocacy work for a Bengaluru manufacturing SME?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Employee advocacy: activating your team's LinkedIn presence to amplify company content + drive collective brand reach. ITD sets up: (1) Employee-content playbook + guidelines + brand voice, (2) Content-sharing calendar with pre-drafted posts employees can share with 1-click customisation, (3) Advocacy platform integration (LinkedIn Elevate replacement like Hootsuite Amplify + EveryoneSocial + BAMBU), (4) Employee-training on LinkedIn best-practices + personal branding basics, (5) Monthly analytics on employee-shared reach + engagement + attributable impact. Effect: 5-15x company post reach + massive hiring + talent + BD lift for scaling firms.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What content works best for a Bengaluru manufacturing SME company page?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Product engineering deep-dives + plant + quality process content + export success stories + industry regulation updates + trade-show recap + supplier + customer partnership announcements. Company page content mix: 30-40% industry thought leadership (from firm brand voice), 20-25% customer + case study + product content, 15-20% team + culture + hiring, 10-15% industry-event + speaking + conference, 10-15% market + regulatory + policy updates, 5-10% CSR + community + values. Video + carousel outperforms text-only 3-5x. In Bengaluru with Bengaluru buyer content-native + long-form-friendly + tech-savvy. LinkedIn used for product marketing + talent-acquisition + fund-raising + BD + community-building. Startup-founder-driven ecosystem.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How much follower growth + engagement should we expect for a Bengaluru manufacturing SME company page?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Month 1-3: 200-800 new followers, 3-6% engagement, 2K-15K post reach. Month 3-6: 800-3,000 followers, 5-10% engagement, 5K-40K post reach, first inbound BD/hiring/customer DMs. Month 6-12: 3K-15K followers, engagement compounds, 20K-100K post reach, consistent inbound lead flow. Month 12+: compounding heavily — India's top manufacturing SME company pages have 50K-500K+ followers. Peer benchmark in Bengaluru varies by industry — banking + IT services + consulting company pages typically have highest follower counts.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How do we integrate company page with individual founder + CXO personal brands?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Reinforcing dual-brand strategy: (1) Company page carries firm-brand + product + team + hiring content, (2) Founder/CXO personal accounts carry individual thought-leadership + industry-thesis + humanised leadership, (3) Employees carry culture + team + advocacy content. All three amplify each other — customer + candidate + investor sees cohesive multi-voice brand. In Bengaluru, top scaling firms (especially SaaS + consulting + PE) run this dual-brand strategy — company + 3-8 senior individual accounts + employee advocacy. ITD Enterprise tier bundles all of this.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What is Life tab + culture content strategy for a manufacturing SME in Bengaluru?</h2>
